# Regions the Idlefy hardened image is published to, one per line. The first
# line is the build region: the image is built there and copied to the rest.
# The build region is us-east-1, where the build's fixed security group
# lives. Adding a region is a line here and the same line in the consumer's
# copy of this list; an opt-in region must first be enabled on the account.
us-east-1
eu-central-1
us-east-2
us-west-2
eu-west-1
eu-west-2
ap-south-1
ap-northeast-1
ap-southeast-1
